//RS //! D-METAREFLECT1 / D-REFLECT1: build comptime reflection handles for user derives.
//RS //!
//RS //! `T.reflect()` in a derive body receives a `TypeInfo` value whose `.fields`,
//RS //! `.methods`, `.type_params`, `.markers`, and `.expanded_markers` expose the
//RS //! target type's shape. `.markers` preserves written markers and their
//RS //! canonical declaration metadata (`sites`, `repeatable`); the expanded view
//RS //! contains only derives lowered from them.
//RS 
